                <invention-title lang="de">BINDEMITTELZUSAMMENSETZUNG, ARTIKEL UND VERFAHREN ZUR HERSTELLUNG DES ARTIKELS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">COMPOSITION DE LIANT, ARTICLE ET PROCÉDÉ DE FABRICATION D'ARTICLE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">BINDER COMPOSITION, ARTICLE, AND METHOD FOR MANUFACTURING ARTICLE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided is a binder composition including polylysine and at least one reducing sugar or a derivative thereof, wherein the polylysine has, in a &amp;lt;sup&amp;gt;1&amp;lt;/sup&amp;gt;H NMR spectrum thereof, a first peak at 3.2 ppm to 3.4 ppm and a second peak at 3.8 ppm to 4.0 ppm, wherein a ratio (A:B) of an area of the first peak (A) to an area of the second peak (B) is 70:30 to 98:2.</p>
            </abstract>
